# Secrets — pattern-based, everywhere in the tree.
# Until 2026-08-10 no secret pattern existed here at all. Real API keys were safe
# only incidentally, because they happened to live under 30_projects/*, which is
# ignored wholesale. A .env in bin/, workstation/, 01_ingest/ or the repo root
# would have been committed. Protection that holds by coincidence does not
# generalize, and the coincidence is invisible until it stops being true.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
credentials.json
client_secret*.json
service-account*.json
*secret*.yaml
*secret*.yml
*.token
.netrc
30_projects/determinism-cost/studies/S3-discriminative-instrument/pilot/batch_01.html
.aider*
